        <mxCell id="t3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#2E7D32&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;MILESTONE 6&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#16202B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Video streaming — GStreamer + WebRTC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#5A6B7B&quot;&gt;Camera &amp;#8594; ROS2 &amp;#8594; GStreamer &amp;#8594; WebRTC &amp;#8594; Browser. Five debugging passes, and the root cause was none of the first four hypotheses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
