        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#1565C0&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;MILESTONE 7&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#16202B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The cloud backend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#5A6B7B&quot;&gt;The control plane&#39;s cloud half, connected end to end. Nothing on the robot side changed at all — which was the entire point of writing the topic contract first.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
