        <mxCell id="t3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#5E35B1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;MILESTONE 9&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#16202B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The operator console&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#5A6B7B&quot;&gt;React + TypeScript + Tailwind, verified against a real, &lt;i&gt;unmodified&lt;/i&gt; Chrome. Getting there surfaced three genuine WebRTC bugs, all fixed at the root.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
