        <mxCell id="t3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#F9A825&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;MILESTONE 11&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#16202B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AWS migration guide&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#5A6B7B&quot;&gt;Every container gets a named AWS service. A verified &lt;b&gt;design&lt;/b&gt;, honestly labelled — no AWS resources were provisioned.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
